	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A VEHICLE EQUIPMENT PROFILE describing the charging features a vehicle requires or supports (plug, current, coupling, charging voltage, maximum charging power and timing). Used to match vehicles to compatible charging equipment."@en ;
