	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The allocation of a public-transport timing point to a site component (such as a PARKING BAY) that holds VEHICLE CHARGING EQUIPMENT; the link that integrates charging infrastructure into the NeTEx public-transport network."@en ;
