	<http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "NeTEx v2.0 element RechargingStation (specialisation of Parking, +v2.0), xsd/netex_part_1/part1_ifopt/netex_rechargingPointAssignment_version.xsd; contains RechargingBay (a PARKING BAY equipped for recharging)." ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A PARKING whose bays (RECHARGING BAYs) are specifically equipped for recharging vehicles. Aggregates the total power available to all of its recharging bays."@en ;
