	<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Equipment at which an electric vehicle can be connected to charge its battery. Renders the NeTEx VEHICLE CHARGING EQUIPMENT (a specialisation of PLACE EQUIPMENT) in a Transmodel/NeTEx style."@en ;
